#!name=🛡️ iOS-NOIR Privacy Shield (定制隐私护盾)
#!desc=拦截三大运营商蜂窝免密取号网关(cmpassport/wostore/id6.me)、数字联盟跨App设备DNA指纹(shuzilm.cn)、JSPatch热更新后门、ThreatMetrix行为键盘监控与国内大厂遥测。
#!system=ios

[Rule]
# https://raw.githubusercontent.com/arnold117/iOS-NOIR/refs/heads/main/shields/ios_noir_shield.module
# === 1. 三大运营商“静默取号/免密网关/蜂窝探针”阻断 (防绕过Wi-Fi偷传手机号) ===
# (注：如果某个App必须用本机号码一键登录时卡住，可临时关闭此段)
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,cmpassport.com,REJECT
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,id6.me,REJECT
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,wostore.cn,REJECT
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,wosms.cn,REJECT
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,hm.wo.cn,REJECT
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,mdn.open.wo.cn,REJECT
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,open.e.189.cn,REJECT
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,id.189.cn,REJECT

